    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Drawer opens from the edge of the window or a local container, keeping users in the current workflow while exposing secondary actions, forms, or details.</source>
        <target state="translated">Drawer 從視窗邊緣或局部容器邊緣滑出，在不打斷目前流程的情況下展示次級操作、表單或詳情。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
